	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"コミックボンボン８月号より連載スタートする「ＳＤ頑駄無　武者○伝」の主役「武者丸」がプラモデルで登場。その勇姿はボンボンでのマンガでご確認下さい。商品は、「武ちゃ丸」形態から「武者丸」形態への変身の再現や，各種武器が付属します。"
		],
		"en": [
			"The main character \"Mushamaru\" of \"SD Gundam Musha○den\", which will be serialized from Comic Bonbon issue 8, is now available as a plastic model. Check out his brave appearance in the manga on Bonbon. The product includes a reproduction of the transformation from \"Buchamaru\" form to \"Mushamaru\" form and various weapons."
		]
